                <pb facs="0713" n="593" sameAs="frus:frus1932v01/pg593"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.51W89 Czechoslovakia/175a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Minister in Czechoslovakia (Ratshesky)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-04-23T13:00:00-05:00">April 23, 1932—1
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>15. Treasury draft of agreement to carry out Congressional Resolution regarding
                    debt postponement was handed to Czechoslovakian Minister some time ago. Treasury
                    insists on necessity of quick action in view of June 15th payment date
                    approaching. Please discuss present situation with appropriate authorities and
                    inquire when action may be expected, reporting fully.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Castle</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
